<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH CHEMOPETROL DM215 MLN, 7YR SYND LOAN.</title>
<headline>CZECH CHEMOPETROL DM215 MLN, 7YR SYND LOAN.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech petrochemical concern Chemopetrol Group a.s. said on Monday it had mandated Citibank International to lead manage a 215 million mark, seven-year syndicated loan.</p>
<p>Company officials told a newsconference that they hoped the loan would be signed by the end of the year.  </p>
<p>They added that funds from the loan will be used mainly to reconstruct a heating plant used at the company which is half-completed.</p>
<p>No further details were immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Dusan Bucanek, Prague Newsroom, 42-2423-0003</p>
